or": "", "background": false, "background_color": "#00000026", "corner_radius": 0, "padding-block-start": 0, "padding-block-end": 0, "padding-inline-start": 0, "padding-inline-end": 0}, "blocks": {}}, "acc": {"type": "accordion", "settings": {"icon": "plus", "dividers": true, "divider_color": "", "type_preset": "h5", "background_color": "", "text_color": "", "border": "none", "border_width": 1, "border_opacity": 100, "border_color": "", "border_radius": 0, "padding-block-start": 0, "padding-block-end": 0, "padding-inline-start": 0, "padding-inline-end": 0}, "blocks": {"r0": {"type": "_accordion-row", "settings": {"heading": "¿Qué foto necesito?", "open_by_default": false, "icon": "none", "width": 20}, "blocks": {"t": {"type": "text", "settings": {"text": "<p>Una foto nítida, con buena luz, en la que se vea bien la cara de tu mascota. Si alguna no sirve, te escribimos antes de empezar para pedirte otra.</p>", "width": "100%", "max_width": "normal", "alignment": "left", "type_preset": "rte", "font": "var(--font-body--family)", "font_size": "1rem", "line_height": "normal", "letter_spacing": "normal", "case": "none", "wrap": "pretty", "text_color": "", "background": false, "background_color": "#00000026", "corner_radius": 0, "padding-block-start": 0, "padding-block-end": 0, "padding-inline-start": 0, "padding-inline-end": 0}, "blocks": {}}}, "block_order": ["t"]}, "r1": {"type": "_accordion-row", "settings": {"heading": "¿Veré el retrato antes de que se imprima?", "open_by_default": false, "icon": "none", "width": 20}, "blocks": {"t": {"type": "text", "settings": {"text": "<p>Sí. En un máximo de 48 horas laborables te enviamos una vista previa digital por correo. Incluye hasta 2 rondas de cambios y no imprimimos nada hasta que nos das el visto bueno. Además, al comprar solo reservamos el importe en tu tarjeta: <strong>no te cobramos hasta que apruebas tu diseño</strong>.</p>", "width": "100%", "max_width": "normal", "alignment": "left", "type_preset": "rte", "font": "var(--font-body--family)", "font_size": "1rem", "line_height": "normal", "letter_spacing": "normal", "case": "none", "wrap": "pretty", "text_color": "", "background": false, "background_color": "#00000026", "corner_radius": 0, "padding-block-start": 0, "padding-block-end": 0, "padding-inline-start": 0, "padding-inline-end": 0}, "blocks": {}}}, "block_order": ["t"]}, "r2": {"type": "_accordion-row", "settings": {"heading": "¿Cuánto tarda en llegar?", "open_by_default": false, "icon": "none", "width": 20}, "blocks": {"t": {"type": "text", "settings": {"text": "<p>Entre 1 y 3 días laborables de producción desde que apruebas la vista previa, más 2 a 4 días de envío a España peninsular (3 a 7 al resto de la Unión Europea). El envío a España cuesta 6,99 € y es gratis en pedidos desde 90 €. Recibirás el número de seguimiento por correo.</p>", "width": "100%", "max_width": "normal", "alignment": "left", "type_preset": "rte", "font": "var(--font-body--family)", "font_size": "1rem", "line_height": "normal", "letter_spacing": "normal", "case": "none", "wrap": "pretty", "text_color": "", "background": false, "background_color": "#00000026", "corner_radius": 0, "padding-block-start": 0, "padding-block-end": 0, "padding-inline-start": 0, "padding-inline-end": 0}, "blocks": {}}}, "block_order": ["t"]}, "r3": {"type": "_accordion-row", "settings": {"heading": "¿Cómo se crean los retratos?", "open_by_default": false, "icon": "none", "width": 20}, "blocks": {"t": {"type": "text", "settings": {"text": "<p>Diseñamos cada retrato con herramientas digitales, incluida inteligencia artificial, a partir de tus fotos, y lo revisamos y ajustamos uno a uno antes de imprimirlo.</p>", "width": "100%", "max_width": "normal", "alignment": "left", "type_preset": "rte", "font": "var(--font-body--family)", "font_size": "1rem", "line_height": "normal", "letter_spacing": "normal", "case": "none", "wrap": "pretty", "text_color": "", "background": false, "background_color": "#00000026", "corner_radius": 0,